<title>USA: Fischer-Watt buys mine property.</title>
<headline>Fischer-Watt buys mine property.</headline>
<dateline>COEUR D'ALENE, Idaho 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fischer-Watt Gold Co Inc said on Wednesday it had acquired the 200-hectare El Veinte mine property in the Oronorte mining district in Colombia, which is 14 kilometers south of the company's El Limon operation.</p>
<p>The new mine's principal quartz vein appears to be thicker and stronger than the half-meter-thick vein at El Limon.  It is anticipated that the El Veinte workings will start providing supplemental ore to the El Limon operation after the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
